<title>CHINA: China Jan-Aug diesel oil output up 14.39 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Aug diesel oil output up 14.39 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diesel oil output in China in the first eight months was 28.99 million tonnes, up 14.39 percent compared with the same period last year, the State Statistical Bureau said in a report on Monday.</p>
<p>Diesel oil production in August alone was 3.83 million tonnes, the report said.</p>
</text>
